OL,3,APrince Harry and six others ordered to
OL,4,Apay initial #9.5m to Daily Mail
OL,5,Apublisher
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince Harry and a group of six other
OL,8,Fhigh-profile figures have been ordered
OL,9,Fto make an initial payment of #9.54m in
OL,10,Flegal costs to the Daily Mail's
OL,11,Fpublisher after they lost their High
OL,12,FCourt privacy case.
OL,14,FThe seven claimants, also including Sir
OL,15,FElton John and Liz Hurley, must pay the
OL,16,Finitial figure by 28 August - and could
OL,17,Fpotentially pay up to #25m more after
OL,18,Fthat in a victory for Associated
OL,19,FNewspapers Limited (ANL).
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
